; The Shell's test (hwdb's test mode runs it: Shell FROM SYS:EFI/planar/S/test)
Info
List SYS:EFI/planar/C
List DIR=SYS:EFI/planar/S QUICK FILES
CD SYS:EFI/planar
Echo The current directory is now SYS:EFI/planar
CD C
CD /
Type S/greeting
Type FROM=S/greeting S/greeting NUMBER
Echo "Two  spaces, quoted, and no newline: " NOLINE
Echo
Echo Every line of SYS:EFI/planar/S/test ran.
